/// returns multiple values then the resulting message will be an array containing all
/// values.
///
/// The full query syntax is described in [jq's
/// documentation](https://stedolan.github.io/jq/manual/).
///
/// ## Error handling
///
/// Queries can fail, in which case the message remains unchanged, errors are logged, and
/// the message is flagged as having failed, allowing you to use [standard processor error
/// handling
